{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "792175dbd0096b7344bb7d5f1286d097f7d73eb661f7568b321f34b41df1130e", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影で、\n貴音に衣装のスーツに着替えてもらった）", "zh": "（为了拍摄写真照杂志《I‧G‧R‧A！！》，\n我请贵音换上了拍摄用的套装。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "9915dd300bf299270b23d7659c5a75f9962c80ece544346349ee21765a58c3a8", "ja": "いかがですか、{$P$}。\n私……、立派なおふぃすれでぃーに見えますか？", "zh": "如何，{$P$}？\n小女子……看起来像一名出社会的粉领族吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e87656c4c15366b6643fdb0b1cd010d80ab292942e59ba296da4d897ebeba548", "ja": "ああ、スーツって言っても、\n就活生のイメージだけど……よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "嗯，虽然是穿套装，\n不过形象是求职的准新鲜人……很适合喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "07119ffecd5b95b0c5acfd87bad9363749462dd1bb1f828a3c7efb42e88337d0", "ja": "そうですか。\nでしたら、良いのですが……。", "zh": "这样啊，\n适合的话是很好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4f2b7ffb99bc3144d44ffd5f5464769cb1d6031f614ae6cc3bf55a40fcb2d28a", "ja": "あれ、何か気になることでもあるのか？\nサイズがキツイとか？", "zh": "咦，难道你有什么在意的地方吗？\n尺寸太小之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "785f4298e36b784ed0471efc0b0a1ac712d130e76e6f86e618a9a2af214b111e", "ja": "いえ、さいずはちょうど良いかと。\nただ……。", "zh": "不，尺寸正好。\n只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "c597b3ec53aa6219c048531810f23ccc7b2e056e4ab3e8f6ff8f30d4d7124286", "ja": "この衣装を着ていると、なにやら普段と少し違う\nような……なんとも面映ゆい気持ちになるのです。", "zh": "穿上这套服装，感觉与平时有些不同……\n让小女子实在很难为情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1007_p", "source_sha256": "158902d533d60d77ef290f2e99fc0553ce67d4fbf3118370d009e6cb63c5a8fb", "ja": "そうなのか……。アイドルはいろんな衣装を着るけど、\nスーツを着る機会は少ないから、かな？", "zh": "原来如此……偶像虽然会穿各式各样的服装，\n穿套装的机会却很少，所以才有这种感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "4e4d1e3d4e03dc21a60dbf80aa4cd77bc491b047e618d5452f8b64c103d4dc92", "ja": "そうかもしれません。そのせいか、撮影ではどのような\n気持ちになればよいのか、迷っている次第で……。", "zh": "或许吧，因此小女子很迷惘，\n不晓得该以什么样的心情拍摄才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c33b6bf59d1a75d34b8c2f231ba8fb23325299e98cac94115eeb71af3da9581a", "ja": "うーん。たとえば、凛としたたたずまいの貴音なら\n知的な学生っぽい雰囲気が出せそうだけど……。", "zh": "嗯～比方说，如果是英气凛然的贵音，\n应该能呈现出知性大学生的气质……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4690cbb2174c540589b307d358007b4791e1f1b506ca86cc7ce13291c05b0cf6", "ja": "よし。ここは敢えてそのまま、\n面映ゆい気持ちのままで撮影を始めようか。", "zh": "好，不如就刻意保持这样，\n用难为情的感觉进行拍摄吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "0592353bf17c8d33b60834e7ea5cd3082e715b0dc392932cc1b784fe92438154", "ja": "えっ……？　こ、このような、\n落ち着かない気持ちのままで、ですか？", "zh": "咦……？\n保、保持这种不自在的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b983c5c19668f66200b29444bf6dd795da79896c915c6ec31a53a19b3d39affb", "ja": "ああ、スーツを着なれていない若者っていうのは、\nコンセプトそのものだしな。それに……。", "zh": "没错，毕竟「不习惯穿套装的年轻人」\n完全符合拍摄主题嘛，而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1fdd3a43bfef5e7ac0c117f2d2810759aaaf3f46213b4480e17a715a78adadef", "ja": "そういう貴音だからこそ、\nまさにフレッシュでかわいいから。", "zh": "就是这样的贵音，\n才更显得清新可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "82345cbe1109c153599f683d55ebe431d1341470a319cf54d993a13b566d4f4c", "ja": "そ……っ。そのように、\nほめていただけるのは、うれしいのですが……。", "zh": "承……承蒙官人如此赞美，\n小女子是很高兴啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c7155cf85b11481976082c28ec9288fa1045f22fe56bb02604bdd98e2c5b5912", "ja": "おっ、いい感じだな。\n手元にカメラが無いのが残念だよ。", "zh": "哦！感觉很棒呢。\n真可惜我手边没有相机。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0103_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "9fbc7368ab3f53033b487a924d439323d4804801713402d61f8cdeacab94d25a", "ja": "うう……あなた様は、本当に……\nいけずです……っ！", "zh": "呜呜……官人真的……\n好坏心眼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
